// The help cards and the role-by-role guide of every page, from Help_Content_Matrix.md (2026-10-19).
// tests/help-roles.test.mjs holds this file equal to the matrix: a card's wording, a role's introduction and
// access note, and the order of its cards. Selectors point at the page's own markup, and the same test checks
// that every class they name exists in the page's components. A card with an empty selector (the restricted
// cards) has nothing to point at: it is shown as a plain card.
